flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[User selects file]
    B --> C{Authenticated?}
    C --|No|--> C1[Redirect to login]
    C1 --> B
    C -- Yes --> D[Client uploads file to API]
    D --> E[API validates input]
    E --> F{Vault key available?}
    F --|No|--> F1[Return error]
    F1 --> Z([End])
    F --|Yes|--> G[Encrypt file AES-256]
    G --> H[Store encrypted blob in S3]
    H --> I[Store metadata in MongoDB]
    I --> J[Write security log]
    J --> K[Return success response]
    K --> Z([End])
